Cx OS
=====

Cx OS is free software licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE).

The desktop shell (shell/), the control utility (cli/) and the base dotfiles (dots/)
are modified forks of the Caelestia project by the Caelestia contributors:

  - https://github.com/caelestia-dots/shell
  - https://github.com/caelestia-dots/cli
  - https://github.com/caelestia-dots/caelestia

All Caelestia code is GPL-3.0 and remains so in this fork. Modifications made for Cx OS
(renaming, performance and memory fixes, Windows 11-style taskbar, tools, etc.) are also GPL-3.0.
